{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-team-contact-tempalte-js","path":"/team/mohamad-samir-horani/contact/","result":{"data":{"strapiTeam":{"services":null,"locations":"Dubai","strapi_id":33,"id":"b073ef65-6b49-5cfa-8318-a3fdaa6988f1","rank":3,"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mohamad_Samir_Horani_89d5535adf.jpg"},"slug":"mohamad-samir-horani","publish":true,"phone":"+971 568 308 221","office_phone":"+971 568 308 221","name":"Mohamad Samir Horani","experience_since":null,"license":"43630","email":"zoyaventure15@gmail.com","designation":"CEO - Business Bay Branch","extra":null,"about":{"data":{"about":"<p>Mohamad Samir Horani joined in September 2020, and he currently serves as a Partner at Zoya Ventures Real Estate. Sam is a leading figure in Dubai’s off-plan sales, guiding both investors and homeowners through the city’s ever-evolving real estate landscape.</p><p>With a career distinguished by over AED 5 billion in high-end property sales, Sam has been at the forefront of some of Dubai’s most iconic transactions including a record-breaking AED 500 million penthouse at Como Residences, the Bugatti Residences (AED 720M), Six Senses (AED 480M), and the Mercedes by Binghatti (AED 200M+), among many other prestigious projects.</p><p>He is a trusted partner to Dubai’s leading developers, including Nakheel, Dubai Holding, Meraas, Emaar Properties, Omniyat, DAMAC, Select Group, Binghatti, Sobha, and AHS Properties. His client network spans the UAE and the wider Gulf region, extending to the United States and Europe.</p><p>Renowned for his sharp market insights and ability to transform trends into opportunities, Mr. Horani has earned recognition and respect from clients and developers alike. At Zoya Ventures Real Estate, he continues to drive growth, secure landmark deals, and ensure every client experience is defined by professionalism, transparency, and trust.</p>"}},"sale_summary":null,"category":{"strapi_json_value":["